 **Formulas:**
-Let $V(x,y,z)$ be the froxel value at integer coordinates. The reconstructed value $\hat{V}$ at the center is:
-$$ \hat{V} = \frac{1}{27} \sum_{dx=-1}^{1} \sum_{dy=-1}^{1} \sum_{dz=-1}^{1} V(x+dx, y+dy, z+dz) $$
-where $x, y, z$ are the integer coordinates of the center froxel [S1, unofficial].
